      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, really? 3-5% above? \n\nI was just looking at some of the raw sensor logs for the last month and the numbers looked a bit... off. It seemed like there was a lot of dust buildup or maybe persistent cloud cover in that sector affecting the output. Are you sure that 3-5% figure is correct? I don't want to get blindsided by the due diligence team if their numbers don't match ours.",
